    "All of these can come with hormonal change, even with regular periods. Many women never have hot flushes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All das kann mit hormonellen Veränderungen einhergehen, auch bei regelmäßiger Periode. Viele Frauen haben nie Hitzewallungen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All of these can come with hormonal change, even with regular periods. Many women never have hot flushes."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Todo esto puede acompañar a los cambios hormonales, incluso con reglas regulares. Muchas mujeres nunca tienen sofocos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout cela peut accompagner les changements hormonaux, même avec des règles régulières. Beaucoup de femmes n’ont jamais de bouffées de chaleur."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tutto questo può accompagnare i cambiamenti ormonali, anche con un ciclo regolare. Molte donne non hanno mai vampate."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dit kan allemaal samengaan met hormonale verandering, ook met een regelmatige menstruatie. Veel vrouwen krijgen nooit opvliegers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
